SUMMARY:TV News: Is This the End of the Road?
DESCRIPTION:Is TV news at the end of its journey\, or on the cusp of reinvention? \nThis evening journalist and author Maya Sharma launches her new book\, Good News\, Bad News\, followed by a wide-ranging conversation with journalists Sharda Ugra and Dhanya Rajendran. Together\, they will reflect on the forces that have reshaped the newsroom from the 24-hour news cycle\, and the race for ratings\, to the influence of social media\, political polarization\, and the evolving expectations of audiences. \nA Q&A session will follow. \nVenue: Seminar Halls\n\n\nEthics\, Politics and Challenges Shaping Broadcast Journalism\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScmeziBKVJpUnsRZrTALNRyDk9gTibGAv4ATVwRX9YAW5zqeg/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Speakers*: Maya Sharma\, Dhanya Rajendran\, Sharda Ugra\n*Event Categories*: Books\, Media
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/tv-news-is-this-the-end-of-the-road/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Books,Media
